title: Kolchak's Coup
subtitle: The SR Directory is arrested.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: dix >= 44 and bol_regime = 1
priority: 15
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {right_threat: 5});
RO.boost(Q, {middle: -2});
if (Q.player_party == 'menshevik') { RO.add(Q, {rel_ally: -3}); }
Q.kolchak_seen = 1;
// the SR members of the Directory are arrested and sent out of the country: they advise no one from now on
Q.avksentiev_advisor = 0;
Q.zenzinov_advisor = 0;
if (Q.player_party == 'sr' && Q.directory_joined) {
    Q.members -= 10 * Q.mem_scale;
    RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -2, middle: -1});
    RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -4, 6);
}
Q.fault_text = RO.fault(Q, 'kolchak');
!}

= Kolchak's Coup

On 18 November, officers loyal to Admiral Alexander Kolchak arrested the SR members of the Directory in Omsk, the anti-Bolshevik government formed at Ufa in September. Kolchak proclaimed himself Supreme Ruler. Avksentiev, Zenzinov and the other SRs arrested with them were put on a train east and sent out of the country by way of China.

[? if fault_flag = 1 : [+ fault_text +] ?]

The other side of the civil war has now shown its hand. A White Russia would be a dictatorship of the officers, and the socialists, of every party, would be in prison.

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' : For the Mensheviks it is a sign that the policy of "neither side" is not so foolish after all, and that armed struggle against the Bolsheviks can only help the Whites. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and directory_joined = 1 : The party had joined the Directory, and its leaders were arrested in their beds. It was the party's attempt to make a democratic government with the help of generals, foreign troops and Cossack atamans, and the generals have answered. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and directory_joined = 0 and armed_struggle = 1 : The party had kept Komuch apart from the Directory. Its people in Omsk were arrested all the same, but the People's Army on the Volga is still the party's own. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 0 : The party had laid down its arms before the officers struck, and its leaders in Moscow, though in prison, have not been shot by officers. ?]

- @sr_turn: Turn the People's Army against Kolchak, and seek a truce with the soviets.
- @sr_fight_on: Fight on against the Bolsheviks, beside the Admiral.

@sr_turn
view-if: player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.white_aid = Math.max(0, Q.white_aid - 1);
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 4, right_threat: -3});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -4);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 2, -2);
Q.komuch_alive = 1;
!}

The Volga units that still obeyed the party turned their guns on Kolchak's officers, and a delegation went to Ufa to ask the Red Army for a truce. The Ufa group, which had warned of the coup for weeks, is now the party's voice in the east.

@sr_fight_on
view-if: player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.komuch_alive = 0;
Q.white_aid += 1;
Q.members -= 5 * Q.mem_scale;
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -3, middle: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -4, 8);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 4, 0);
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: -3});
!}

The party's people in the east were told to serve under the Admiral, for the sake of the war against the Bolsheviks. Many did not; those who did will be fighting for a government that has just arrested their leaders.
